            type: "paragraph",
            text: "Someone concerned about alcohol or drug use can request a confidential health assessment before a crisis occurs. Encourage treatment without blame. People considering stopping alcohol after long periods of heavy use should discuss withdrawal risks with a clinician first. [8]",
